######################################################################################################################
# Source Name						: iclgrejevntamtsetmn001.scr
# Date								: 26-02-2013
# Description						: It is an event basedscript for event type IWREJ, event id REJECT and bacid PNLCHQUN.
#		`								If the rejeciton code is 63 then the event amount is set as 2000 else it is 1000.
# Input Values						: None
# Output Values						: To set the amount.
# Called Scripts					: None
# Calling Script					: getcparamvalue.scr
# Author     						: Manoj
# Bank								: Equity Bank,KENYA
# Modification History				:
#		< Version No.> 		<Date>		<Author Name> 		<Description>
